  "details": "This is a very niche request, however, with the discovery and rise of force-replaced avatars, it would be nice to report an avatar you're wearing or favourited.\nThe reason why I've requested this is that merely a few hours ago I was in public and had my avatar changed to one with over 14 million polygons!!!! It almost crashed me and potentially did to others.\nI've favourited to hopefully get a friend to report it when they're next online, will be done in a private world obviously.",
